# Squash solo - Phase 1 C: Both Sides
@description Solo practice for one court, about 50 minutes, on the shots that use both walls:
  boasts and cross-courts, forehand to backhand volleys, boasts and lobs, the serve, and length
  when tired, with ghosting after every two drills. Play sessions A, B and C in turn. Each drill has
  a target; hit every target in two of these sessions in a row to move up.
@speech rate 1.1
@minimum gap 0:00.8
@workout squash
@artwork ../images/squash.jpg

## Intro
Phase one, session C: both sides. Boasts, cross-courts, the serve, and length when you're tired.
Drills with a phase two target say so. Hit every target in two of these sessions in a row to move
up.

